# F2 — Remediation Log

Chronological trail of the F2 fix (handshake signer↔identity binding). Sequence exact.

## Design (before delegation)
- Read `validate_proof` (`trustchain/…/mod.rs:365-402`) + both bilateral.rs call sites myself. Confirmed `validate_proof` takes only `&[u8]` (no peer_pubkey) → binding CANNOT go inside without a trait change → enforce at call sites (peer_pubkey in scope there), keeping the trait stable for its 3+ other consumers.
- Confirmed at accept site (bilateral.rs): `peer_pubkey` (from `verify_identity_binding`) + proof bytes both reachable. Same at initiate.

